es, Gangā spoke, saying, \"O god, I am incapable of sustaining this new sprung energy of yours: I am burning with that fire, and my consciousness fails me.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.635,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-37-15"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1036015","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"83f1041da807f2a7905422b7da6a46b62de90a2535886a919bc35ee69079d910","compact":"de64726988ae68a658be1242f003b2a91428325b09d912c85c68d1271c0681dd","nasal":"2c7f7315523396b208a75ca19446e9f6595fcc54f7bc948c11990c2f5ce8f151"}},{"id":"VRCE-1-36-16","kanda":1,"kandaId":"bala","sarga":36,"verse":16,"english":"Thereupon that partaker of the oblations offered to the gods, said to Ganga, 'Do you bring forth your embryo on the side of this Himavat!'","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.86,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-37-16"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1036016","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"cad07c39923f558c15e6de7de16b504325948cd7ee80825a6a9738063825bf78","compact":"f88f82c69b793b7d5d6d8acfa342c9a17f16a1df1c90e65032e57350e40e8e97","nasal":"ad5ce25f116ecacd5cf50a38c259b6097c75a1fe8e20889f581a17143b1173fc"}},{"id":"VRCE-1-36-17","kanda":1,"kandaId":"bala","sarga":36,"verse":17,"english":"Hearing Agni's words, Gangă of mighty energy cast her exceedingly effulgent embryo on her streams, O sinless one.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-37-17"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1036017","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"f5df03ff420e7942557d6e8f0b64e1a1b57c9745be1b74a785b1b83748e16712","compact":"b0485634fc92c93f0cb6df2bdce120197aa45c0d502fa48b19a7017a9a683900","nasal":"3c3bb4d2b34dc557e97dca69d5ff6371cc5e